#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "C0n7r0l5"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"One client runs on a desktop, a phone and a headset, so every action has a "
"way in from each of them. The keyboard has the most; touch, a gamepad and "
"the XR controllers carry the actions a match needs, and the Settings menu "
"reaches the rest -- including from a headset, where there is no keyboard at "
"all. This page is also the in-game help's (`/` or `?`)."
msgstr ""
"0n3 cl13n7 run5 0n 4 d35k70p, 4 ph0n3 4nd 4 h34d537, 50 3v3ry 4c710n h45 4 "
"w4y 1n fr0m 34ch 0f 7h3m. 73h k3yb04rd h45 73h m057; 70uch, 4 g4m3p4d 4nd "
"73h XR c0n7r0ll3r5 c4rry 73h 4c710n5 4 m47ch n33d5, 4nd 73h 53771ng5 m3nu "
"r34ch35 73h r357 -- 1nclud1ng fr0m 4 h34d537, wh3r3 7h3r3 15 n0 k3yb04rd 47 "
"4ll. 7h15 p4g3 15 4l50 73h 1n-g4m3 h3lp'5 (`/` 0r `?`)."

