"`Esc` — b4ck 0u7 0n3 573p: 3x17 ch47 1npu7, l34v3 full5cr33n, l34v3 m0u53 "
"5733r1ng, 7h3n 0p3n 53771ng5. Pr3551ng 17 4g41n cl0535 53771ng5, 50 17 15 "
"4lw4y5 54f3 70 pr355 0n3 m0r3 71m3"

