msgstr "`Settings -> Radar: ...` — cycl3 5h0r7/M3d1um/L0ng r4d4r pr35375"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`B` — toggle the voice microphone"
msgstr "`B` — 70ggl3 73h v01c3 m1cr0ph0n3"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Settings -> Audio Settings` — set the game, voice, and microphone levels, "
"and choose the voice channel: All, Nearby, or Team"
msgstr ""
"`Settings -> Audio Settings` — 537 73h g4m3, v01c3, 4nd m1cr0ph0n3 l3v3l5, "
"4nd ch0053 73h v01c3 ch4nn3l: 4ll, N34rby, 0r 734m"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`/` or `?` — show/hide help panel"
msgstr "`/` 0r `?` — 5h0w/h1d3 h3lp p4n3l"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`🎤` beside the gear — the microphone, as `B` is: a green border means you "
"are transmitting and a red one means you are not, and the hover text names "
"the channel it would speak on"
msgstr ""
"`🎤` b351d3 73h g34r — 73h m1cr0ph0n3, 45 `B` 15: 4 gr33n b0rd3r m34n5 j00 "
"4r3 7r4n5m1771ng 4nd 4 r3d 0n3 m34n5 j00 4r3 n07, 4nd 73h h0v3r 73x7 n4m35 "
"73h ch4nn3l 17 w0uld 5p34k 0n"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`▲` beside the gear — hide the scoreboard and chat, leaving the name row and "
"the chat tabs; `▼` brings them back. Typing a message borrows the chat "
"window until you are done with it, and `U` or `7` borrows the scoreboard "
"until the hunt cursor closes; tapping a chat tab opens chat for good. Small "
"screens start collapsed"
msgstr ""
"`▲` b351d3 73h g34r — h1d3 73h 5c0r3b04rd 4nd ch47, l34v1ng 73h n4m3 r0w 4nd "
"73h ch47 74b5; `▼` br1ng5 7h3m b4ck. 7yp1ng 4 m3554g3 b0rr0w5 73h ch47 "
"w1nd0w un71l j00 4r3 d0n3 w17h 17, 4nd `U` 0r `7` b0rr0w5 73h 5c0r3b04rd "
"un71l 73h hun7 cur50r cl0535; 74pp1ng 4 ch47 74b 0p3n5 ch47 f0r g00d. 5m4ll "
"5cr33n5 574r7 c0ll4p53d"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Settings -> Anaglyph 3D` — red/cyan glasses; `Settings -> VR Mode` enters a "
"WebXR headset"
msgstr ""
"`Settings -> Anaglyph 3D` — r3d/cy4n gl45535; `Settings -> VR Mode` 3n73r5 4 "
"WebXR h34d537"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Menus"
msgstr "M3nu5"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Up` / `Down` — previous/next control, including from inside a text field"
