"`Left` / `Right` — ch4ng3 73h f0cu53d c0n7r0l: m0v3 4 5l1d3r, p1ck 73h n3x7 "
"ch01c3. 1n 4 73x7 f13ld 7h3y m0v3 73h cur50r 1n5734d"

#: docs/help/controls.md
