msgstr "`Enter` 0r `Space` — pr355 73h f0cu53d c0n7r0l"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Click or tap a row that walks a list: the title steps back and the current "
"option steps forward. The `‹` and `›` on the row mark the two halves"
msgstr ""
"Cl1ck 0r 74p 4 r0w 7h47 w4lk5 4 l157: 73h 717l3 573p5 b4ck 4nd 73h curr3n7 "
"0p710n 573p5 f0rw4rd. 73h `‹` 4nd `›` 0n 73h r0w m4rk 73h 7w0 h4lv35"

#: docs/help/controls.md
