"73h h3lp p4n3l 15 r34d r47h3r 7h4n 0p3r473d, 50 7h3r3 73h 4rr0w5 5cr0ll 17 "
"4nd 0nly `Left` / `Right` m0v3 f0cu5"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Hunting"
msgstr "Hun71ng"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Marking a player puts a cyan `◎` on their scoreboard row, a cyan ring on "
"their radar blip, and a beacon in the sky over them in their own tank colour "
"-- so several marked at once are still told apart at a glance. While one of "
"them is in your sights the HUD says **SPOTTED:** and a ping sounds once a "
"second from where they are. In Rabbit Chase the rabbit is marked for you, "
"and its beacon is cyan like its ring: everyone is hunting it, so everyone's "
"mark over it says so."
msgstr ""
"M4rk1ng 4 pl4y3r pu75 4 cy4n `◎` 0n 7h31r 5c0r3b04rd r0w, 4 cy4n r1ng 0n "
"7h31r r4d4r bl1p, 4nd 4 b34c0n 1n 73h 5ky 0v3r 7h3m 1n 7h31r 0wn 74nk c0l0ur "
"-- 50 53v3r4l m4rk3d 47 0nc3 4r3 571ll 70ld 4p4r7 47 4 gl4nc3. Wh1l3 0n3 0f "
"7h3m 15 1n j00r 51gh75 73h HUD 54y5 **SPOTTED:** 4nd 4 p1ng 50und5 0nc3 4 "
"53c0nd fr0m wh3r3 7h3y 4r3. 1n R4bb17 Ch453 73h r4bb17 15 m4rk3d f0r j00, "
"4nd 175 b34c0n 15 cy4n l1k3 175 r1ng: 3v3ry0n3 15 hun71ng 17, 50 3v3ry0n3'5 "
"m4rk 0v3r 17 54y5 50."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`U` — hunt: open the scoreboard cursor, and press it again on a running hunt "
"to clear every mark"
msgstr ""
"`U` — hun7: 0p3n 73h 5c0r3b04rd cur50r, 4nd pr355 17 4g41n 0n 4 runn1ng hun7 "
"70 cl34r 3v3ry m4rk"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`7` — add hunt: the same cursor, but committing adds to what is marked "
"rather than replacing it, and committing on a row already marked takes it off"
msgstr ""
"`7` — 4dd hun7: 73h 54m3 cur50r, bu7 c0mm1771ng 4dd5 70 wh47 15 m4rk3d "
"r47h3r 7h4n r3pl4c1ng 17, 4nd c0mm1771ng 0n 4 r0w 4lr34dy m4rk3d 74k35 17 0ff"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Settings -> Hunt` — the same thing without a keyboard, for a phone or a "
"headset. Left and right step through `Clear` and then the players in "
"alphabetical order; select marks or unmarks whoever is shown, or clears "
"every mark on `Clear`. On a touch screen or with a mouse, tap a chevron to "
"step and anywhere else on the row to select"
msgstr ""
"`Settings -> Hunt` — 73h 54m3 7h1ng w17h0u7 4 k3yb04rd, f0r 4 ph0n3 0r 4 "
"h34d537. L3f7 4nd r1gh7 573p 7hr0ugh `Clear` 4nd 7h3n 73h pl4y3r5 1n "
"4lph4b371c4l 0rd3r; 53l3c7 m4rk5 0r unm4rk5 wh03v3r 15 5h0wn, 0r cl34r5 "
"3v3ry m4rk 0n `Clear`. 0n 4 70uch 5cr33n 0r w17h 4 m0u53, 74p 4 ch3vr0n 70 "
"573p 4nd 4nywh3r3 3l53 0n 73h r0w 70 53l3c7"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"With the cursor open, the board's heading reads `*SEL*` and a pulsing `○` "
"sits on the row it is on, filling in to `◎` when you commit. `Up` / `Down` "
"move it, `Enter` commits, and `U` or `7` backs out keeping whatever was "
"already marked. `I` and `Space` move the cursor too, so a surface without "
"arrow keys can reach it"
msgstr ""
"W17h 73h cur50r 0p3n, 73h b04rd'5 h34d1ng r34d5 `*SEL*` 4nd 4 pul51ng `○` "
"5175 0n 73h r0w 17 15 0n, f1ll1ng 1n 70 `◎` wh3n j00 c0mm17. `Up` / `Down` "
"m0v3 17, `Enter` c0mm175, 4nd `U` 0r `7` b4ck5 0u7 k33p1ng wh473v3r w45 "
"4lr34dy m4rk3d. `I` 4nd `Space` m0v3 73h cur50r 700, 50 4 5urf4c3 w17h0u7 "
"4rr0w k3y5 c4n r34ch 17"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "As an observer"
msgstr "45 4n 0b53rv3r"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"As an Observer you have no tank. Drive and turn fly the camera instead, "
"`Tab` climbs and `Space` descends, and holding `Shift` makes drive tilt the "
"view up and down and turn slide it sideways. The camera rests at the eye "
"height of a tank on the ground, and travel stays level however the view is "
"tilted. Pausing and self-destruct do nothing."
msgstr ""
"45 4n 0b53rv3r j00 h4v3 n0 74nk. Dr1v3 4nd 7urn fly 73h c4m3r4 1n5734d, "
"`Tab` cl1mb5 4nd `Space` d35c3nd5, 4nd h0ld1ng `Shift` m4k35 dr1v3 71l7 73h "
"v13w up 4nd d0wn 4nd 7urn 5l1d3 17 51d3w4y5. 73h c4m3r4 r3575 47 73h 3y3 "
"h31gh7 0f 4 74nk 0n 73h gr0und, 4nd 7r4v3l 574y5 l3v3l h0w3v3r 73h v13w 15 "
"71l73d. P4u51ng 4nd 53lf-d357ruc7 d0 n07h1ng."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Enter` or `C` — step through everything: in each view, the leader first, "
"then every player, then on to the next view. The views are Free, Track, "
"Follow, Driving with, and Flag where a map has team flags"
msgstr ""
"`Enter` 0r `C` — 573p 7hr0ugh 3v3ry7h1ng: 1n 34ch v13w, 73h l34d3r f1r57, "
"7h3n 3v3ry pl4y3r, 7h3n 0n 70 73h n3x7 v13w. 73h v13w5 4r3 Fr33, 7r4ck, "
"F0ll0w, Dr1v1ng w17h, 4nd Fl4g wh3r3 4 m4p h45 734m fl4g5"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`I` or right-click — in the Free view, watch the tank in your sights, or "
"show the obstacle there: what it is, an outline round it, and its block from "
"the map file with the `group` blocks that placed it"
msgstr ""
"`I` 0r r1gh7-cl1ck — 1n 73h Fr33 v13w, w47ch 73h 74nk 1n j00r 51gh75, 0r "
"5h0w 73h 0b574cl3 7h3r3: wh47 17 15, 4n 0u7l1n3 r0und 17, 4nd 175 bl0ck fr0m "
"73h m4p f1l3 w17h 73h `group` bl0ck5 7h47 pl4c3d 17"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Right-click or tap an obstacle anywhere on screen, in any view and the "
"Overview most of all, to show it the same way"
msgstr ""
"R1gh7-cl1ck 0r 74p 4n 0b574cl3 4nywh3r3 0n 5cr33n, 1n 4ny v13w 4nd 73h "
"0v3rv13w m057 0f 4ll, 70 5h0w 17 73h 54m3 w4y"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Pick nothing -- the sky, or empty ground in the Overview -- or press the "
"panel's **World** button for the whole world: what is in it, faces, "
"textures, the map file's warnings and its largest meshes, each of which "
"shows that mesh"
msgstr ""
"P1ck n07h1ng -- 73h 5ky, 0r 3mp7y gr0und 1n 73h 0v3rv13w -- 0r pr355 73h "
"p4n3l'5 **W0rld** bu770n f0r 73h wh0l3 w0rld: wh47 15 1n 17, f4c35, "
"73x7ur35, 73h m4p f1l3'5 w4rn1ng5 4nd 175 l4rg357 m35h35, 34ch 0f wh1ch "
"5h0w5 7h47 m35h"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Click a scoreboard row to watch that player; click the marked row again to "
"go back to following the leader"
msgstr ""
"Cl1ck 4 5c0r3b04rd r0w 70 w47ch 7h47 pl4y3r; cl1ck 73h m4rk3d r0w 4g41n 70 "
"g0 b4ck 70 f0ll0w1ng 73h l34d3r"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "M0u53"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`M` turns mouse steering on and off, and nothing else does: the keys never "
"take it away behind your back."
msgstr ""
"`M` 7urn5 m0u53 5733r1ng 0n 4nd 0ff, 4nd n07h1ng 3l53 d035: 73h k3y5 n3v3r "
"74k3 17 4w4y b3h1nd j00r b4ck."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "The targeting box"
msgstr "73h 74rg371ng b0x"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"The two boxes in the middle of the screen are the steering, as in BZFlag. "
"Where the cursor sits relative to their centre is what the tank does:"
msgstr ""
"73h 7w0 b0x35 1n 73h m1ddl3 0f 73h 5cr33n 4r3 73h 5733r1ng, 45 1n BZFlag. "
"Wh3r3 73h cur50r 5175 r3l471v3 70 7h31r c3n7r3 15 wh47 73h 74nk d035:"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"**Inside the inner box, nothing.** It is the dead zone: park the cursor "
"there to stop."
msgstr ""
"**1n51d3 73h 1nn3r b0x, n07h1ng.** 17 15 73h d34d z0n3: p4rk 73h cur50r "
"7h3r3 70 570p."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"**Between the boxes, more the further out.** Up is forward and down is "
"reverse; left and right turn. Each grows evenly from nothing at the inner "
"box's edge to full at the outer box's."
msgstr ""
"**B37w33n 73h b0x35, m0r3 73h fur7h3r 0u7.** Up 15 f0rw4rd 4nd d0wn 15 "
"r3v3r53; l3f7 4nd r1gh7 7urn. 34ch gr0w5 3v3nly fr0m n07h1ng 47 73h 1nn3r "
"b0x'5 3dg3 70 full 47 73h 0u73r b0x'5."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"**At or past the outer box, full.** Each axis stops growing on its own, so "
"running the cursor out past the top keeps the tank at full speed and leaves "
"left and right free to steer."
msgstr ""
"**47 0r p457 73h 0u73r b0x, full.** 34ch 4x15 570p5 gr0w1ng 0n 175 0wn, 50 "
"runn1ng 73h cur50r 0u7 p457 73h 70p k33p5 73h 74nk 47 full 5p33d 4nd l34v35 "
"l3f7 4nd r1gh7 fr33 70 5733r."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"**Reverse is half speed**, as it is from the keys, however far down the "
"cursor goes."
